  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "t1_b",
  "tier": 1,
  "name": "Security Network B",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 1 gentle start: solo patrols only, no paired robots, MFA, carts or hardened gates. All routes always classify FREE.",
    "Route A (top) winds through two bends and has a patrolled loop; a service-door robot may pace before slot A3.",
    "Route B (middle) dips south in the centre; its optional slot B2 sits on the dip. Service robot pace before B3.",
    "Route C (bottom) hugs the lower edge with an ambient robot that grants T1_MAINT (carries into tier 2).",
    "Exit room has a fixed camera at [42,9]. Exit trigger is cell [41,11]."
  ],
